WEBVTT

00:13:29.448 --> 00:13:30.767
Ovo je naš svemirski brod,

00:13:30.767 --> 00:13:31.874
Sojuz, ovaj maleni.

00:13:31.874 --> 00:13:33.339
Nas trojica se penjemo unutra,

00:13:33.339 --> 00:13:35.791
a potom se svemirski brod
razdvaja od stanice

00:13:35.791 --> 00:13:37.461
i pada u atmosferu.

00:13:37.461 --> 00:13:39.083
Ova dva dela ovde

00:13:39.083 --> 00:13:42.317
se u stvari istope, mi ih odbacimo,
a oni sagore u atmosferi.

00:13:42.329 --> 00:13:44.582
Jedini deo koji preživljava,
je mali metak

00:13:44.582 --> 00:13:45.758
u kojem se mi vozimo,

00:13:45.758 --> 00:13:47.796
i koji pada kroz atmosferu.

00:13:47.796 --> 00:13:49.372
U suštini,

00:13:49.372 --> 00:13:52.933
vi meteoritom putujete kuci,

00:13:52.933 --> 00:13:55.866
a voziti meteroit je strašno,

00:13:55.866 --> 00:13:57.379
a i mora biti.

00:13:57.379 --> 00:13:59.618
Umesto da vozimo kroz atmosferu

00:13:59.618 --> 00:14:01.366
uz vrisku, kao što biste radili